.nh
.TH "PB-UPDATE-SETTINGS" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-update-settings - View or change automatic update settings


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb update settings [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Show or change this machine's automatic update schedule.

.PP
Official installations enable scheduled updates by default. Source and custom
installations default to availability checks only. Scheduled updates download
and verify releases ahead of the maintenance time, then install at that time
using the machine's local clock. The default maintenance time is 04:00.

.PP
Disabling automatic updates keeps availability checks enabled but leaves
downloads and installation to manual commands. Manual update check, download,
and install commands remain available either way. These settings apply to the
machine, independently of the selected account.

.PP
JSON output is supported with --json.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--auto\fP[=false]
	enable or disable scheduled downloads and installs

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for settings

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print JSON

.PP
\fB--time\fP=""
	set the machine-local daily update time (HH:MM)


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override

.PP
\fB--workspace\fP=""
	resource workspace selector: personal or a team slug


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  pb update settings
  pb update settings --auto=false
  pb update settings --auto=true --time 22:15
  pb update settings --time 04:30 --json
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb-update(1)\fP
